        <div class="check">
          Prognoza na koniec miesiąca:
          <b>${fc?.available && fc.average_kwh != null ? `${this._fmtNum(fc.average_kwh, 3)} PLN/kWh` : "—"}</b>
          <span class="muted">limit ${limit != null ? `${this._fmtNum(limit, 3)} PLN/kWh` : "—"}</span>
          ${fc?.available
